WEBVTT

00:00:01.002 --> 00:00:13.670
We are OpsCrew. We built this expense exception prototype from zero in Google AI Studio Build. Gemini plans and reviews the handling steps. Our teammate used Antigravity to assist deployment.

00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:27.477
I explicitly start a Firebase visitor session. This synthetic example is a thirty-eight-dollar parking expense for employee SYNTH-EMP-100, with a missing receipt.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.175
Gemini extracts facts, then a separately prompted Planner proposes handling steps. A Reviewer checks the proposal. This timer measures elapsed time.

00:01:10.001 --> 00:01:16.234
Completed role attempts appear after the response; it is not live progress inside each stage.

00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:47.935
The current result requests receipt evidence. Clause SYN-004 asks for an itemized receipt or a written explanation. The passing plan and review grant no permission to create a case, reimburse or pay.

00:02:08.001 --> 00:02:19.861
I prepare human confirmation, inspect this specific plan, and explicitly authorize the synthetic exception record. The checkbox starts unchecked. I now submit that authorization.

00:02:28.002 --> 00:02:40.577
Success appears only after a separate read of the saved record. I refresh this visitor's history and reopen the same case. OpsCrew does not approve reimbursement, issue payment or send a message automatically.
